@startuml
' Sequence: drop a transition from library onto a cut

actor User
participant "Transitions catalog" as Cat
participant TimelineView
participant TimelineEditor
participant Clip
participant EditorViewModel
participant TransitionResolver
participant FrameCompositor

User -> Cat : drag CrossDissolve
User -> TimelineView : drop on cut between A and B
activate TimelineView
TimelineView -> TimelineEditor : SetTransitionOut(A, CrossDissolve, 0.5s)\nSetTransitionIn(B, CrossDissolve, 0.5s)
activate TimelineEditor
TimelineEditor -> Clip : A.transitionOut = ref
TimelineEditor -> Clip : B.transitionIn = ref
note right
  Also nudge overlap window:
  extend A out / B in by duration/2
  (or require user overlap).
  Persist via project JSON.
end note
deactivate TimelineEditor
TimelineView -> TimelineView : draw transition badge on cut
deactivate TimelineView

... scrub into transition window ...

EditorViewModel -> TransitionResolver : FindActive(timeSec)
TransitionResolver --> EditorViewModel : ActiveTransition(A, B, t01)
EditorViewModel -> FrameCompositor : blended layer (single)
FrameCompositor --> EditorViewModel : frame

@enduml
